umented 2026 event has concluded; future dates and registration requirements should be confirmed through the University.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iwu-turning-titan","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Turning Titan Orientation","title":"Spend Five Days Turning Titan","subtitle":"New students begin with a named fall-orientation rite","notes":"Plan to attend the full program, meet your first-year adviser and use Titan Orientation Leaders to learn campus resources.","short_summary":"Incoming students formally enter campus life through Illinois Wesleyan’s multi-day orientation program.","evidence_claim":"Illinois Wesleyan describes Turning Titan as a multi-day fall program for community-building, advising and resource introductions and lists it as mandatory for first-year and transfer students.","source_url":"https://www.iwu.edu/orientation/titan/index.html","source_title":"Turning Titan (Fall Orientation)","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The 2026 program runs August 19–23 for new students and August 20–23 for transfer students; no registration is required.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iwu-tommy-titan","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Tommy the Titan","title":"Cheer for a Chariot-Born Titan","subtitle":"The gladiator mascot carries a campus-specific backstory","notes":"Spot Tommy at campus gatherings, then trace the character from a 1951 illustration to the photographed 1965 chariot entrance.","short_summary":"Illinois Wesleyan’s named gladiator mascot entered school lore with an actual Roman-style chariot appearance.","evidence_claim":"Illinois Wesleyan credits alumnus Lee Short ’44 with creating Tommy’s gladiator image and name in 1951 and records Tommy’s 1965 football pregame entrance in a Roman-style chariot.","source_url":"https://www.iwu.edu/about/traditions/